# Design System

## Color Tokens

| Token          | Hex       | Tailwind                     | Usage                          |
|----------------|-----------|------------------------------|--------------------------------|
| Coral          | `#E85D3A` | `text-[#E85D3A]` / `bg-[#E85D3A]` | CTAs, active states, progress |
| Sage           | `#2D5F4E` | `text-[#2D5F4E]` / `bg-[#2D5F4E]` | Confirmations, "Done", map   |
| Background     | `#FAFAF8` | `bg-[#FAFAF8]`              | Page background (warm off-white) |
| Surface        | `#FFFFFF` | `bg-white`                   | Cards                          |
| Text primary   | `#1A1A1A` | `text-[#1A1A1A]`            | Headings, body text            |
| Text secondary | `#6B6B6B` | `text-[#6B6B6B]`            | Captions, metadata             |
| Border         | `#E8E6E2` | `border-[#E8E6E2]`          | Dividers, card borders         |

## Typography

- Headings: `font-['DM_Serif_Display'] tracking-tight`
- Body text: `font-['DM_Sans']`
- Data / time / monospace: `font-['JetBrains_Mono'] tabular-nums`
- Italic prompts (e.g., "Which would you rather do?"): `font-['Playfair_Display'] italic`

## Component Recipes

**Cards**
`bg-white rounded-xl shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]`

**Primary CTA button**
`bg-[#E85D3A] text-white h-11 rounded-lg font-medium text-sm`

**Secondary button**
`border border-[#E8E6E2] rounded-lg h-11 text-sm font-medium`

**Done / confirm button**
`bg-[#2D5F4E] text-white h-11 rounded-lg font-semibold shadow-[0_3px_12px_rgba(45,95,78,0.45)]`

**Category pills**
`rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-sm` — coral fill (`bg-[#E85D3A] text-white`) when selected, border-only (`border border-[#E8E6E2]`) when not

**Glass pills (on images)**
`bg-white/16 border border-white/28 backdrop-blur-[10px] rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-white text-xs font-medium`

**Bottom sheets**
Use the `vaul` Drawer (already available as shadcn `Drawer` in `ui/drawer.tsx`). Style the handle and overlay, add `rounded-t-2xl bg-white`.

## Layout

- Design viewport: 390×844 (iPhone 14) — build mobile-first, let it scale
- Touch targets: minimum `h-11` (44px) on all interactive elements
- Page padding: `px-5` (20px) horizontal
- Card gaps: `gap-3` (12px)
- Section spacing: `pt-6` or `pt-5` between major sections

## Avatar Stack Pattern

Overlapping circular avatars with offset `ml-[-9px]` and `z-index` descending. Each avatar gets a unique background from the palette:

```
#FDDFD4 / #C44B29 (coral)
#D4EAE3 / #1E5A44 (sage)
#F5ECD4 / #8A6020 (gold)
#EAD4F5 / #6B2D8A (purple)
#D4E8F5 / #1E5A8A (blue)
```
